  "bodyHash": "18a1f6a61a1c62a7",
  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fsaltywateroriginal\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8CfU4zp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"62\" height=\"33\"></a></p>\n<p>為了撿起掉落在地上的火把而必須先將其破壞，這讓我困擾了許久，既然沒人做這個功能，我決定自己製作一個模組。</p>\n<p>這個簡單的模組 <del>賦予史蒂夫實用的雙手</del> 讓你能夠透過右鍵點擊來拾取火把。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HXDMQTI.gif\"></p>\n<p>它同樣適用於紅石火把、非激活的紅石火把、靈魂火把、燈籠與靈魂燈籠。花朵與蘑菇也包含在內！<br><strong>火把與燈籠在玩家手中會以 3D 物品模型呈現，且握持姿勢正確（位於頭部高度）</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>設定檔提供白名單功能，讓你自訂允許拾取的模組方塊。此外還有自訂關鍵詞列表，你可自行啟用/停用或編輯，模組將根據點擊的方塊 ID 進行比對以識別是否為可拾取物件。若關鍵詞列表誤判了你不想拾取的物品，你也能使用黑名單將其排除。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組需要 Player Animator 1.0.2&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator</a></p>\n<p>所有專案現已轉移至：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fsaltywater\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/p1YdKLT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"50\"></a></p>\n<p>歡迎任何人在整合包中使用此模組，或在影片中展示。請發送私人訊息附上連結，讓我也能遊玩該整合包或觀看影片。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">同時別忘了來看看我的其他模組，它們皆著重於沉浸感與更高的真實度，非常歡迎提供任何回饋。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/salty-s-realistic-forging\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YM3h2s3.png\" alt=\"Realistic Forging\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simplywalk\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UckeY7D.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jumpanimation\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m1WGasZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sitting\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S8sFjIk.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/find-the-treasure\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y37f1GQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trashbinned\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I8WXCEp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CiRnH8e.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/craftingtakestime\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962260/description_c05e2ade-ee28-45b2-93e5-93859f4a2265.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#169179\">我也開發 Vintage Story 模組！歡迎在此查看：<a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmods.vintagestory.at%252flist%252fmod%253fsortby%253dlastreleased%2526sortdir%253ddesc%2526text%253d%2526side%253d%2526userid%253d20368%2526mv%253d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SaltyWater</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>祝好。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
